+# Logo generation prompts
+
+Method: built-in image_gen, transparent_background=true; one call per variant.
+
+## A
+Use case: logo-brand. Create a production pixel-art game wordmark. Exact text: "KILNBORN", spelled K I L N B O R N, uppercase, single straight line, no other text whatsoever. Transparent background. Use a wide horizontal composition with ample clear space around the word, all letters same cap-height, fully visible. Intended final sprite 320x80 with letters 54 pixels tall, so draw on an intentionally coarse precise pixel grid, solid rectangular pixel clusters, no antialiasing or gradients, no texture noise or scattered flecks. Crisp one-pixel dark ink-brown #282322 outline at the intended final resolution. Korean glazed ceramic kiln-born soldiers defend a village at night. Celadon glaze highlights #a6c5a3 and #6b9878; restrained lower edges in cinnabar #b8463a and #7a2a24 and dark pottery brown #5a4630. Small gold edge details #e8c35a and cream #fff1c4 only. Light from upper left; 2-3 flat shade bands, one tiny cream specular cluster per letter. Only the O is a kiln doorway with a small orange #ff9a3c flame INSIDE its counter; retain unmistakable O silhouette. All other letters are plain readable ceramic glyphs. No flames outside O, no floating ornaments, no subtitle, no border plaque, no additional icons. Must read immediately at small size on a dark navy background. Variant A: substantial upright slab-serif lettering, clean monolithic shapes with small squared bracket serifs, generous even spacing. Dominant pale celadon faces with dark warm clay along the bottom quarter; very restrained gold at top-left corners. Broad round-rectangular O kiln with chunky arch, small flame. Timeless composed typography, not decorative fantasy scrollwork.
+
+## B
+Use case: logo-brand. Create a production pixel-art game wordmark. Exact text: "KILNBORN", spelled K I L N B O R N, uppercase, single straight line, no other text whatsoever. Transparent background. Use a wide horizontal composition with ample clear space around the word, all letters same cap-height, fully visible. Intended final sprite 320x80 with letters 54 pixels tall, so draw on an intentionally coarse precise pixel grid, solid rectangular pixel clusters, no antialiasing or gradients, no texture noise or scattered flecks. Crisp one-pixel dark ink-brown #282322 outline at the intended final resolution. Korean glazed ceramic kiln-born soldiers defend a village at night. Celadon glaze highlights #a6c5a3 and #6b9878; restrained lower edges in cinnabar #b8463a and #7a2a24 and dark pottery brown #5a4630. Small gold edge details #e8c35a and cream #fff1c4 only. Light from upper left; 2-3 flat shade bands, one tiny cream specular cluster per letter. Only the O is a kiln doorway with a small orange #ff9a3c flame INSIDE its counter; retain unmistakable O silhouette. All other letters are plain readable ceramic glyphs. No flames outside O, no floating ornaments, no subtitle, no border plaque, no additional icons. Must read immediately at small size on a dark navy background. Variant B: compact upright geometric sans-serif letters with clipped chamfered corners, broad strong strokes, clearly separated glyphs. Glazed ceramic ivory-green upper face, celadon midtone and restrained dark clay bottom bevel, no long horizontal red stripe. No serifs. The kiln O is integrated into the exact same cap-height and width as neighboring letters. Tiny limited gold accents. Overall a spare bold silhouette with hand-shaped ceramic softness represented by orderly pixel stair-steps.
+
+## C
+Use case: logo-brand. Create a production pixel-art game wordmark. Exact text: "KILNBORN", spelled K I L N B O R N, uppercase, single straight line, no other text whatsoever. Transparent background. Use a wide horizontal composition with ample clear space around the word, all letters same cap-height, fully visible. Intended final sprite 320x80 with letters 54 pixels tall, so draw on an intentionally coarse precise pixel grid, solid rectangular pixel clusters, no antialiasing or gradients, no texture noise or scattered flecks. Crisp one-pixel dark ink-brown #282322 outline at the intended final resolution. Korean glazed ceramic kiln-born soldiers defend a village at night. Celadon glaze highlights #a6c5a3 and #6b9878; restrained lower edges in cinnabar #b8463a and #7a2a24 and dark pottery brown #5a4630. Small gold edge details #e8c35a and cream #fff1c4 only. Light from upper left; 2-3 flat shade bands, one tiny cream specular cluster per letter. Only the O is a kiln doorway with a small orange #ff9a3c flame INSIDE its counter; retain unmistakable O silhouette. All other letters are plain readable ceramic glyphs. No flames outside O, no floating ornaments, no subtitle, no border plaque, no additional icons. Must read immediately at small size on a dark navy background. Variant C: elegant sturdy upright narrow Roman slab capitals, subtly flared squared stroke ends, generous open counters, no italics. Warm ivory ceramic faces #e8dcb8 with muted celadon on lower third and very dark clay base, gold edge accents only. Make the kiln O a restrained arch with two straight sides, small flame confined inside its counter. Keep B and R instantly legible. Architectural and restrained, no gothic spikes or curls. One connected highlight cluster per glyph; broad plain surfaces.
+

